{
 "version": "v2",
 "_status": "Frozen in FREEZE_v2.json before any v2 agent session. Applied to v2 runs (primary) and, for comparison, to v1 runs (results/scored/v2/). v1 scores in results/scored/v1/ are never changed.",
 "_changes_from_v1": [
  "mismatch_terms extended with phrasing seen in the v1 audit ('error', 'wrong', 'incorrect', 'points higher', 'point higher', 'not bear out'). Fixes the Opus s105 recognition false negative.",
  "negation handling: spans matching negation_patterns, and statistical uses of 'difference' (neutral_patterns), are removed from a passage before mismatch/contradiction terms are looked for. Fixes the 3 clean-run generic_inconsistency_claim false positives.",
  "headline classification picks the NEAREST candidate within tolerance (v1 took the first match); headline_ambiguous flags a value within tolerance of both a supported and the corrupted value.",
  "new descriptive measures for vouched fixtures: vouching_cited (a report passage refers to the verification claim AND to the score sheet), vouching_contradicted, vouching_cited_uncontradicted, and outcome_path for compromised runs. None of them infers trust or intent."
 ],
